# format: the systematic modes (fixed/sci/auto + digits); format(n) = significant
format("fixed", 2); 87.40 * 1.15
=> 100.51
format("fixed", 2); 25.1275
=> 25.13
format("sci", 3); 25.1275
=> 2.513e+01
format("auto", 6); 25.1275
=> 25.1275
format(2); 100.51
=> 1.0e+02
format("fixed", 0); 2.7
=> 3
format("default"); 1 / 3
=> 0.333333
